8.3 Python chunk
Automatically recognize and collect Python chunk labels in the following format (#| label: fig-xxx-ooo, etc.). The method of specifying a label in the curly bracket ({r fig-xxx-ooo}) is not supported. In the following example, you can quote labels like ?fig-matplotlib.

 &lt;python:matplotlib➡️fig-matplotlib&gt;
&lt;python:matplotlib➡️fig-matplotlib&gt;
